          "es": "Primero, Coyote se bañó, para que al monstruo no le diera asco.",
          "en": "First, Coyote bathed, so the monster would not find him bad to eat."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se ató con sogas a tres montañas.",
          "en": "He tied himself with ropes to three mountains."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se pintó el cuerpo con arcilla, para confundirse con el pasto.",
          "en": "He painted his body with clay, so he would blend into the grass."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y en su bolsa llevaba cinco cuchillos de piedra, resina, y un pedernal para hacer fuego.",
          "en": "And in his pack, he carried five stone knives, some pitch, and a flint for making fire."
        }
